   $q$In paragraph 5, the blanket patterns are described as "intricate." Which meaning does the context support?$q$, $q$[{"text":"made from only one plain color","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"hung high on a sunroom wall","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"surface-association"},{"text":"having many small, detailed parts","is_correct":true},{"text":"woven quickly in a single day","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$having many small, detailed parts$q$, $q$The colon introduces "diamonds nested inside larger diamonds" and "dozens of small repeating shapes in five colors," so intricate means detailed and complex. The blankets do hang on the wall, but that is where they are, not what the word describes.$q$, 'draft', '5439b18a-a4f1-5547-9e26-ad34e22bc669')
